HOW TO USE THIS CANDLE
How to Use:
1) Trim the wick to about 0.5 cm before lighting.
2) Place the candle on a flat, heat-resistant surface.
3) Do not burn for more than 3 hours at a time.
4) Keep away from children and pets.
5) Extinguish the flame before leaving the room.
  
